---
// RAER budget card paired with the 5 Optimization Design Levels pyramid.
const W = 900;
const H = 316;
---
<figure class="ge5a">
  <div class="ge5a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Resource-Aware Efficiency Requirements (RAER) budget on the left paired with the five Optimization Design Levels from System down to Hardware on the right.">
      {/* Left card: RAER contract */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="388" height="284" rx="10" class="ge5a-card" />
      <text x="30" y="44" class="ge5a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Written RAER efficiency contract</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Bản cam kết hiệu năng RAER</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="356" height="44" rx="6" class="ge5a-box" />
      <text x="42" y="79" class="ge5a-b">Operation &amp; Dataset</text>
      <text x="42" y="96" class="ge5a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Sum() on X million 9-digit integers in file</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sum() trên file chứa N dòng số nguyên</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="114" width="356" height="44" rx="6" class="ge5a-box is-red" />
      <text x="42" y="133" class="ge5a-b-red">Max Latency Target</text>
      <text x="42" y="150" class="ge5a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>&lt;= 10 ns/line (1 CPU)  or  2.5 ns/line (4 CPUs)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>&lt;= 10 ns/dòng (1 CPU)  hoặc  2.5 ns/dòng (4 CPU)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="168" width="356" height="44" rx="6" class="ge5a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="42" y="187" class="ge5a-b-ok">Memory &amp; CPU Budget</text>
      <text x="42" y="204" class="ge5a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Heap &lt;= 10 KB regardless of file size</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>RAM Heap &lt;= 10 KB bất kể kích thước file</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="224" width="356" height="60" rx="6" class="ge5a-box" />
      <text x="42" y="246" class="ge5a-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why write RAER down first?</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chốt RAER trước để làm gì?</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="264" class="ge5a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Know when to stop — avoid premature complexity.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Biết điểm dừng — tránh tối ưu mù gây rối code.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: 5 Design Levels */}
      <rect x="422" y="16" width="464" height="284" rx="10" class="ge5a-card" />
      <text x="438" y="44" class="ge5a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Optimization Design Levels (10x gain each)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Năm tầng thiết kế tối ưu (mỗi tầng 10–20x)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="438" y="62" width="432" height="38" rx="6" class="ge5a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="452" y="85" class="ge5a-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>L1 System — service boundaries, async queues, caching</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tầng 1 Hệ thống — tách service, queue, thêm cache</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="438" y="108" width="432" height="38" rx="6" class="ge5a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="452" y="131" class="ge5a-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>L2 Algorithm &amp; Data — streaming vs O(N^2) loops</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tầng 2 Thuật toán — streaming, giảm độ phức tạp</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="438" y="154" width="432" height="38" rx="6" class="ge5a-box" />
      <text x="452" y="177" class="ge5a-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>L3 Code &amp; Compiler — fewer allocs, inline hints</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tầng 3 Code &amp; Compiler — giảm cấp phát, inline</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="438" y="200" width="432" height="38" rx="6" class="ge5a-box" />
      <text x="452" y="223" class="ge5a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>L4 OS &amp; Containers — CFS CPU quota, mmap, SSD</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tầng 4 Hệ điều hành — cgroup quota, mmap, SSD</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="438" y="246" width="432" height="38" rx="6" class="ge5a-box is-muted" />
      <text x="452" y="269" class="ge5a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>L5 Hardware — CPU L1/L2 cache lines, RAM bus, NUMA</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tầng 5 Phần cứng — CPU cache line, bus RAM, NUMA</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Efficiency tuning starts by writing a concrete RAER budget, then choosing the highest impactful design level first—higher architectural wins often make low-level micro-tricks unnecessary.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tối ưu hiệu năng bắt đầu từ việc chốt ngân sách RAER rõ ràng, rồi ưu tiên xử lý ở tầng thiết kế cao nhất trước — sửa đúng tầng hệ thống hay thuật toán thường bỏ luôn nhu cầu chế mẹo phức tạp bên dưới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge5a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge5a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge5a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge5a text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge5a-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge5a-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge5a-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge5a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge5a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge5a-box.is-muted { opacity: 0.85; }
  .ge5a-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge5a-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge5a-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge5a-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge5a-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge5a-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .ge5a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
